{"id": "f00fee07-af60-4454-81dd-889eee2ca6fa", "slug": "vanguard-premium-apparel", "title": "Vanguard - Premium Apparel", "description": "Vanguard Premium Button Component is designed for building reusable UI components in modern web projects. Key features include reusable structure, responsive behavior, and production-ready presentation. It is suitable for component libraries and responsive product interfaces.", "content": "---\nversion: \"neuform-staff-featured-2026-05-22\"\nname: \"Vanguard - Premium Apparel\"\ndescription: \"Vanguard Premium Button Component is designed for building reusable UI components in modern web projects. Key features include reusable structure, responsive behavior, and production-ready presentation. It is suitable for component libraries and responsive product interfaces.\"\ncolors:\n  primary: \"#FF4F18\"\n  secondary: \"#FFFFFF\"\n  accent: \"#A08C6C\"\n  background: \"#FFFFFF\"\n  surface: \"#A08C6C\"\n  text-primary: \"#111827\"\n  text-secondary: \"#4B5563\"\n  border: \"#E5E7EB\"\ntypography:\n  display-lg:\n    fontFamily: \"Inter\"\n    fontSize: \"64px\"\n    fontWeight: 500\n    lineHeight: \"1.04\"\n    letterSpacing: \"0\"\n  body-md:\n    fontFamily: \"Inter\"\n    fontSize: \"16px\"\n    fontWeight: 400\n    lineHeight: \"1.6\"\n  label-md:\n    fontFamily: \"JetBrains Mono\"\n    fontSize: \"12px\"\n    fontWeight: 600\n    lineHeight: \"1.2\"\nspacing:\n  base: \"8px\"\n  gap: \"16px\"\n  card-padding: \"24px\"\n  section-padding: \"80px\"\nrounded:\n  card: \"8px\"\n  control: \"8px\"\n  pill: \"9999px\"\ncomponents:\n  card:\n    background: \"Use the surface token with subtle borders and HTML-matched shadow depth\"\n    radius: \"Match the declared card radius token\"\n  button:\n    background: \"Use primary or accent colors for the main action\"\n    radius: \"Use the control or pill radius based on the source HTML\"\n---\n# Vanguard - Premium Apparel\nSource: Neuform staff featured templates. Author: Sakura DesignCode (@sakura-designcode). Views: 47; favorites: 9; remixes: 3.\nTags: button, animated, dither, action, effect, cta.\n## Overview\nVanguard Premium Button Component is designed for building reusable UI components in modern web projects. Key features include reusable structure, responsive behavior, and production-ready presentation. It is suitable for component libraries and responsive product interfaces.\n\nVanguard Collections About Vanguard Pure Form. Pure You. Vanguard www.vanguard.build Fall / Winter 2024 Explore Collection\n## Composition\nUse the attached HTML reference as the source of truth. Preserve the visible hierarchy, first-screen composition, section rhythm, density, and interaction tone before adapting copy or content.\nKey visible headings include: Vanguard.\n## Colors\nAnchor the palette in primary #FF4F18, secondary #FFFFFF, accent #A08C6C, background #FFFFFF, surface #A08C6C, text-primary #111827. Keep background, surface, text, and border roles distinct so generated layouts retain the same contrast pattern as the source.\n## Typography\nUse Inter for display moments and Inter for body copy unless the HTML clearly demands a compatible fallback. Labels and technical metadata should use JetBrains Mono or an equivalent mono face.\n## Layout\nKeep spacing deliberate and stable. Favor the same grid direction, max-width behavior, card density, and responsive stacking seen in the HTML. Do not replace distinctive source structures with generic SaaS sections.\n## Components\nAuthentication and CTA controls should preserve the source button hierarchy, input density, and focused conversion path.\n## Motion\nPreserve existing motion cues such as masked reveals, staggered entrance, hover lift, scroll-triggered transitions, and ambient movement. Keep easing smooth and restrained.\n## WebGL & Effects\n\nIf the source includes canvas, WebGL, Three.js, gradients, particles, or atmospheric effects, rebuild them as supporting layers behind the content. Keep effects performant, responsive, and secondary to the interface.\n\n## Guardrails\n- Do not flatten the source into a generic card grid.\n- Do not swap the color mode unless the source clearly supports it.\n- Preserve the first viewport signal, focal object, and visual density.\n- Keep buttons, cards, and badges aligned to the same radius and border language.", "preview_html": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\" class=\"antialiased selection:bg-[#FF4F18] selection:text-black\">\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <title>Vanguard - Premium Apparel</title>\n    <script src=\"https://cdn.tailwindcss.com\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://code.iconify.design/iconify-icon/1.0.7/iconify-icon.min.js\"></script>\n    <link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\">\n    <link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.gstatic.com\" crossorigin>\n    <link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@300;400;500&display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n    <script>\n        tailwind.config = {\n            theme: {\n                extend: {\n                    fontFamily: {\n                        sans: ['Inter', 'sans-serif'],\n                    },\n                    colors: {\n                        brand: {\n                            orange: '#FF4F18',\n                            dark: '#0A0A0A',\n                            surface: '#151515',\n                        }\n                    },\n                    letterSpacing: {\n                        tighter: '-0.04em',\n                        tight: '-0.02em',\n                    }\n                }\n            }\n        }\n    </script>\n    <style>\n        /* Base Setup */\n        body {\n            background-color: #050505;\n            color: #ffffff;\n            overflow-x: hidden;\n            font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;\n        }\n\n        /* 3D Scene Setup */\n        .scene-container {\n            perspective: 2000px;\n            transform-style: preserve-3d;\n        }\n\n        .interactive-wrapper {\n            transform-style: preserve-3d;\n            transition: transform 0.1s cubic-bezier(0.25, 0.46, 0.45, 0.94);\n            will-change: transform;\n        }\n\n        /* Texture Generators */\n        .noise-overlay {\n            position: absolute;\n            inset: 0;\n            background-image: url(\"data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg viewBox='0 0 200 200' xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%3E%3Cfilter id='noiseFilter'%3E%3CfeTurbulence type='fractalNoise' baseFrequency='0.8' numOctaves='3' stitchTiles='stitch'/%3E%3C/filter%3E%3Crect width='100%25' height='100%25' filter='url(%23noiseFilter)'/%3E%3C/svg%3E\");\n            opacity: 0.12;\n            mix-blend-mode: overlay;\n            pointer-events: none;\n            z-index: 10;\n        }\n\n        .orange-noise {\n            opacity: 0.25;\n            mix-blend-mode: multiply;\n        }\n\n        /* Plastic Wrap Effect for Dark Tag */\n        .plastic-wrap {\n            position: relative;\n            overflow: hidden;\n            box-shadow:\n                inset 0 0 0 1px rgba(255,255,255,0.05),\n                inset 0 2px 10px rgba(255,255,255,0.1),\n                0 20px 40px rgba(0,0,0,0.8);\n        }\n\n        .plastic-wrap::before {\n            content: '';\n            position: absolute;\n            inset: -50%;\n            background:\n                linear-gradient(115deg, transparent 20%, rgba(255,255,255,0.08) 30%, transparent 45%),\n                linear-gradient(245deg, transparent 40%, rgba(255,255,255,0.05) 50%, transparent 60%),\n                radial-gradient(ellipse at 80% 20%, rgba(255,255,255,0.1) 0%, transparent 40%);\n            transform: rotate(-15deg);\n            pointer-events: none;\n            z-index: 5;\n            mix-blend-mode: screen;\n        }\n\n        /* Wrinkle simulation */\n        .plastic-wrap::after {\n            content: '';\n            position: absolute;\n            inset: 0;\n            background:\n                repeating-linear-gradient(\n                    45deg,\n                    transparent,\n                    transparent 10px,\n                    rgba(255,255,255,0.02) 10px,\n                    rgba(255,255,255,0.02) 11px\n                ),\n                radial-gradient(circle at 30% 70%, rgba(255,255,255,0.05) 0%, transparent 30%);\n            pointer-events: none;\n            z-index: 6;\n            mix-blend-mode: color-dodge;\n        }\n\n        /* String Styling */\n        .string-path {\n            fill: none;\n            stroke: #a08c6c; /* Twine color */\n            stroke-width: 2.5;\n            stroke-linecap: round;\n            stroke-linejoin: round;\n            filter: drop-shadow(0 4px 6px rgba(0,0,0,0.5));\n        }\n\n        .string-texture {\n            stroke: #6b5c43;\n            stroke-width: 0.5;\n            stroke-dasharray: 1 2;\n        }\n\n        /* Hole punch */\n        .hole-punch {\n            box-shadow: inset 0 3px 5px rgba(0,0,0,0.8), 0 1px 1px rgba(255,255,255,0.1);\n        }\n\n        .orange-tag .hole-punch {\n             box-shadow: inset 0 3px 5px rgba(0,0,0,0.4), 0 1px 1px rgba(255,255,255,0.3);\n        }\n\n        /* Animations */\n        .anim-element {\n            opacity: 0;\n            filter: blur(10px);\n            transform: translateY(20px);\n            transition: all 1s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1);\n        }\n\n        .anim-element.in-view {\n            opacity: 1;\n            filter: blur(0);\n            transform: translateY(0);\n        }\n\n        .word {\n            display: inline-block;\n            opacity: 0;\n            transform: translateY(10px);\n            filter: blur(4px);\n            transition: all 0.6s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1);\n        }\n\n        .word.in-view {\n            opacity: 1;\n            transform: translateY(0);\n            filter: blur(0);\n        }\n\n        /* Barcode setup */\n        .barcode-bar {\n            background-color: #FF4F18;\n            height: 100%;\n        }\n\n        /* Dynamic Button */\n        .dynamic-btn {\n            background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(255,79,24,0.1) 0%, rgba(255,79,24,0) 100%);\n            border: 1px solid rgba(255,79,24,0.3);\n            transition: all 0.3s ease;\n        }\n        .dynamic-btn:hover {\n            border-color: rgba(255,79,24,0.8);\n            box-shadow: 0 0 20px rgba(255,79,24,0.2), inset 0 0 10px rgba(255,79,24,0.1);\n            transform: translateY(-2px);\n        }\n    </style>\n</head>\n<body class=\"min-h-screen flex flex-col items-center selection:bg-brand-orange selection:text-white\">\n\n    <!-- Navigation -->\n    <nav class=\"fixed top-0 w-full px-6 py-6 flex justify-between items-center z-50 mix-blend-difference anim-element\" style=\"transition-delay: 0.2s;\">\n        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-white\">\n            <!-- SVG Logo Mark -->\n            <svg width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\">\n                <path d=\"M12 2L2 22H9.5L12 17L14.5 22H22L12 2Z\" fill=\"currentColor\"/>\n                <path d=\"M12 9L9.5 14H14.5L12 9Z\" fill=\"#050505\"/>\n            </svg>\n            <span class=\"text-sm tracking-widest uppercase font-medium\">Vanguard</span>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"flex gap-6 items-center\">\n            <a href=\"#\" class=\"text-xs text-neutral-400 hover:text-white transition-colors uppercase tracking-widest\">Collections</a>\n            <a href=\"#\" class=\"text-xs text-neutral-400 hover:text-white transition-colors uppercase tracking-widest\">About</a>\n            <button class=\"w-8 h-8 rounded-full border border-neutral-800 flex items-center justify-center hover:bg-white hover:text-black transition-colors\">\n                <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:bag-linear\" width=\"16\"></iconify-icon>\n            </button>\n        </div>\n    </nav>\n\n    <!-- Main Hero Section -->\n    <main class=\"flex-grow w-full flex items-center justify-center relative overflow-hidden scene-container h-screen\">\n\n        <!-- Ambient Background Glow -->\n        <div class=\"absolute inset-0 flex items-center justify-center pointer-events-none z-0\">\n            <div class=\"w-[60vw] h-[60vw] bg-brand-orange rounded-full opacity-[0.03] blur-[120px] mix-blend-screen transform -translate-y-10\"></div>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- 3D Interactive Wrapper -->\n        <div class=\"interactive-wrapper relative w-[320px] h-[580px] z-10 sm:w-[380px] sm:h-[680px]\" id=\"tag-container\">\n\n            <!-- SVGs for Strings (Rendered behind and over tags via z-index in paths) -->\n            <svg class=\"absolute top-[-150px] left-1/2 transform -translate-x-1/2 w-[300px] h-[300px] overflow-visible pointer-events-none z-30\" viewBox=\"0 0 300 300\">\n                <!-- String for Orange Tag (Back) -->\n                <path class=\"string-path\" d=\"M150,-50 C160,20 230,80 185,150\" />\n                <path class=\"string-path string-texture\" d=\"M150,-50 C160,20 230,80 185,150\" />\n                <path class=\"string-path\" d=\"M185,150 C170,190 200,210 215,225\" />\n\n                <!-- String for Dark Tag (Front, loops through hole) -->\n                <path class=\"string-path\" d=\"M140,-60 C120,10 70,60 115,130\" />\n                <path class=\"string-path string-texture\" d=\"M140,-60 C120,10 70,60 115,130\" />\n\n                <!-- Loop part over the dark tag -->\n                <path class=\"string-path\" d=\"M115,130 C130,150 145,170 115,190\" />\n                <path class=\"string-path string-texture\" d=\"M115,130 C130,150 145,170 115,190\" />\n\n                <!-- Loose ends -->\n                <path class=\"string-path\" d=\"M115,190 C100,220 120,250 90,280\" stroke-opacity=\"0.7\"/>\n                <path class=\"string-path\" d=\"M215,225 C230,250 210,270 240,300\" stroke-opacity=\"0.6\"/>\n            </svg>\n\n            <!-- Bottom Tag (Orange) -->\n            <div class=\"orange-tag absolute w-[240px] h-[480px] bg-brand-orange rounded-sm sm:w-[280px] sm:h-[560px] top-[40px] right-[-20px] shadow-2xl origin-top\"\n                 style=\"transform: translateZ(-30px) rotateZ(18deg) rotateY(10deg); transition: transform 0.8s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1);\">\n                <div class=\"noise-overlay orange-noise\"></div>\n\n                <!-- Hole -->\n                <div class=\"absolute top-6 left-1/2 transform -translate-x-1/2 w-4 h-4 rounded-full bg-[#050505] hole-punch z-20\"></div>\n\n                <!-- Content -->\n                <div class=\"absolute inset-0 flex flex-col items-center justify-center p-8 z-10\">\n                    <div class=\"transform -rotate-90 flex flex-col items-center gap-3\">\n                        <!-- Black Logo Mark -->\n                        <svg width=\"48\" height=\"48\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" class=\"transform rotate-90\">\n                            <path d=\"M12 2L2 22H9.5L12 17L14.5 22H22L12 2Z\" fill=\"#000000\"/>\n                        </svg>\n                        <h2 class=\"text-black text-4xl sm:text-5xl font-medium tracking-tight uppercase whitespace-nowrap mt-4\">Vanguard</h2>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Top Tag (Dark Plastic) -->\n            <div class=\"dark-tag absolute w-[240px] h-[480px] bg-[#121212] rounded-sm sm:w-[280px] sm:h-[560px] top-0 left-0 plastic-wrap origin-top anim-element\"\n                 style=\"transform: translateZ(40px) rotateZ(-8deg); transition-delay: 0.4s;\">\n                <div class=\"noise-overlay\"></div>\n\n                <!-- Hole -->\n                <div class=\"absolute top-6 left-1/2 transform -translate-x-1/2 w-4 h-4 rounded-full bg-[#050505] hole-punch z-20\"></div>\n\n                <!-- Content Container -->\n                <div class=\"absolute inset-0 flex flex-col justify-between p-8 pt-20 z-10\">\n\n                    <!-- Top Text (Slogan) -->\n                    <div class=\"text-brand-orange text-lg sm:text-xl font-normal leading-snug tracking-tight word-anim-container max-w-[150px]\">\n                        <span class=\"word\">Pure</span>\n                        <span class=\"word\">Form.</span><br>\n                        <span class=\"word\">Pure</span>\n                        <span class=\"word\">You.</span>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <!-- Middle/Bottom Section -->\n                    <div class=\"flex flex-col gap-6 w-full\">\n\n                        <!-- Logo & Brand Name -->\n                        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3\">\n                             <svg width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\">\n                                <path d=\"M12 2L2 22H9.5L12 17L14.5 22H22L12 2Z\" fill=\"#FF4F18\"/>\n                            </svg>\n                            <span class=\"text-brand-orange text-xl tracking-tight uppercase font-medium\">Vanguard</span>\n                        </div>\n\n                        <!-- Tiny URL & Arrow -->\n                        <div class=\"flex justify-between items-center border-t border-white/10 pt-3 relative\">\n                             <!-- Faint reflection line across this area -->\n                            <div class=\"absolute top-0 left-[-50px] w-[200%] h-[1px] bg-white opacity-10 transform -rotate-6\"></div>\n\n                            <span class=\"text-brand-orange text-[9px] tracking-widest uppercase opacity-80\">www.vanguard.build</span>\n                            <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:arrow-right-linear\" class=\"text-brand-orange text-xs\"></iconify-icon>\n                        </div>\n\n                        <!-- Barcode Simulation -->\n                        <div class=\"w-full h-10 flex gap-[2px] items-end pb-1 opacity-90 mix-blend-screen\" id=\"barcode-container\">\n                            <!-- JS will populate varying widths here to look like a real barcode -->\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Bottom CTA / Anchor -->\n        <div class=\"absolute bottom-10 left-1/2 transform -translate-x-1/2 flex flex-col items-center gap-4 z-40 anim-element\" style=\"transition-delay: 0.8s;\">\n            <p class=\"text-xs text-neutral-500 uppercase tracking-widest font-normal\">Fall / Winter 2024</p>\n            <button class=\"dynamic-btn px-8 py-3 rounded-full text-brand-orange text-xs uppercase tracking-widest font-medium flex items-center gap-2 backdrop-blur-sm\">\n                Explore Collection\n                <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:arrow-right-up-linear\" width=\"14\"></iconify-icon>\n            </button>\n        </div>\n\n    </main>\n\n    <script>\n        document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', () => {\n\n            // --- Barcode Generator ---\n            const barcodeContainer = document.getElementById('barcode-container');\n            // Generate random thin/thick bars\n            const barPattern = [2, 1, 3, 1, 1, 4, 2, 1, 1, 2, 3, 1, 2, 1, 1, 2, 1, 4, 1, 2, 1, 1, 3];\n            let html = '';\n            barPattern.forEach(width => {\n                // Random height slightly varied for realistic print errors, mostly full height\n                const height = Math.random() > 0.9 ? '80%' : '100%';\n                html += `<div class=\"barcode-bar\" style=\"width: ${width}px; height: ${height}\"></div>`;\n            });\n            barcodeContainer.innerHTML = html;\n\n            // --- 3D Mouse Tracking (WebGL-lite feel) ---\n            const wrapper = document.getElementById('tag-container');\n            const scene = document.querySelector('.scene-container');\n\n            // Subtle spring physics variables\n            let mouseX = 0;\n            let mouseY = 0;\n            let targetX = 0;\n            let targetY = 0;\n            let currentX = 0;\n            let currentY = 0;\n\n            scene.addEventListener('mousemove', (e) => {\n                const rect = scene.getBoundingClientRect();\n                const x = e.clientX - rect.left;\n                const y = e.clientY - rect.top;\n\n                // Normalize from -1 to 1 based on center\n                mouseX = ((x / rect.width) - 0.5) * 2;\n                mouseY = ((y / rect.height) - 0.5) * 2;\n            });\n\n            scene.addEventListener('mouseleave', () => {\n                mouseX = 0;\n                mouseY = 0;\n            });\n\n            function render3D() {\n                // Ease towards target\n                targetX = mouseX * 25; // max rotation degrees X\n                targetY = mouseY * 25; // max rotation degrees Y\n\n                currentX += (targetY - currentX) * 0.1; // Invert mapping for natural tilt\n                currentY += (targetX - currentY) * 0.1;\n\n                // Apply transform to the whole wrapper\n                if (wrapper) {\n                     wrapper.style.transform = `rotateX(${-currentX}deg) rotateY(${currentY}deg)`;\n                }\n\n                requestAnimationFrame(render3D);\n            }\n            render3D();\n\n            // --- Scroll & Reveal Animations ---\n            const observerOptions = {\n                root: null,\n                rootMargin: '0px',\n                threshold: 0.1\n            };\n\n            const observer = new IntersectionObserver((entries) => {\n                entries.forEach(entry => {\n                    if (entry.isIntersecting) {\n                        entry.target.classList.add('in-view');\n\n                        // If it contains word animations, trigger them with stagger\n                        const words = entry.target.querySelectorAll('.word');\n                        if (words.length > 0) {\n                            words.forEach((word, index) => {\n                                setTimeout(() => {\n                                    word.classList.add('in-view');\n                                }, 600 + (index * 150)); // Base delay + stagger\n                            });\n                        }\n\n                        observer.unobserve(entry.target);\n                    }\n                });\n            }, observerOptions);\n\n            document.querySelectorAll('.anim-element, .word-anim-container').forEach(el => {\n                observer.observe(el);\n            });\n        });\n    </script>\n</body>\n</html>", "preview_file_name": "vanguard-premium-apparel.html", "thumbnail_url": "https://hoirqrkdgbmvpwutwuwj.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/design-system-thumbnails/staff-featured-2026-05-22/vanguard-premium-apparel.jpg", "source_name": "vanguard-premium-apparel-DESIGN.md", "views": 154, "forks": 6, "private": false, "featured": true, "created_by": "f78092cf-e149-48ff-99e9-efabe9a28d39", "created_at": "2026-05-22T07:58:12.433844+00:00", "updated_at": "2026-07-03T11:05:18.639113+00:00"}